          Student Class
       
     Object s1        Object s2
     Roll = 101       Roll = 101
     Name = Ankit      Name = Ankit
        │                 │
     Identity 1        Identity 2

both location different in memory.

cout << &s1 << endl; 
cout << &s2 << endl;

